      "bbox": {
        "l": 90.57,
        "t": 707.3899999999999,
        "r": 562.6778999999995,
        "b": 667.5039999999998
      },
      "content": "Chloride and sulphate are interactive. In pass-through systems the sum of the squares must not exceed 85000. For recirculating systems with proper controls and treatment, the sum of the squares may be up to 520000. Note that the sulphate value must include any sulphite present."
